<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-28T00:08:55.860Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:08:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel is intensifying airstrikes and artillery on southern Lebanon, targeting Hezbollah rocket sites and launchers, while drones fly over Beirut. Hezbollah is using Lebanese fishing boats to monitor Israeli naval forces, prompting Israeli claims of espionage. Lebanese Prime Minister says a proposal is under way for UN peacekeepers to remain as UNIFIL prepares to withdraw from south Lebanon without a clear successor plan. Lebanon fears Israel may impose a maritime buffer zone in its southern waters, and a French plan calls for a phased withdrawal of international forces after UNIFIL leaves. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQYVNUWEJudWFFMWRvc0x3TEpNaGJVU3J0dnJ0dEdNazdJRGlIT2NxTlIwY1cwaW5nbERWQ1FZdlk1blNtZXBYZGVkblNOQnV3WmtNTEI1Szk1OE5Ha2licVJnZktYcnE5T3ZKdGFEcy1wSWFYb1BETW5qSDVmc1ljU0x4QkxZWURUVUhuM3pQeDkzUVQ2RV96OTVJTDEyQW9Fb0Roc2lR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPUUUzbFd5WDFXNTYydndiLVJ5YWZ5aWRXTEZweHB6NjdWei1NWENEc0J1aDcyeW1xSTFidTQzMDlZQXZCOGF3enFJSTFxZXUtVkdqMmszTkNWLV9ERm8taXRaTi1odXZjTTZ1anZMVGRacUdvSGZqM1BXLXVicGEwUkdvcUNSVXJrQThiSmNzOFVIUTg1c1pJZ1NSVDloYXVpa2ZNcUNsMDZocTkwMVA1QUxXMkRjdER3bWxFcA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://english.aawsat.com/arab-world/5346470-lebanon-fears-israel-may-impose-maritime-buffer-zone-southern-waters&quot;&gt;english.aawsat.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://english.aawsat.com/arab-world/5346467-french-plan-post-unifil-lebanon-calls-phased-withdrawal-int%E2%80%99l-forces&quot;&gt;english.aaw